Metrics List:
- {"name": "container_ulimits_soft", "type": "gauge", "description": "Soft ulimit values for the container root process."}
- {"name": "container_fs_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that are consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_spec_memory_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Memory limit for the container."}
- {"name": "container_fs_limit_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Number of bytes that can be consumed by the container on this filesystem."}
- {"name": "container_memory_usage_bytes", "type": "gauge", "description": "Current memory usage in bytes, including all memory regardless of when it was accessed"}
Question: Show the filesystem usage and limit bytes for all containers of the auth service.

Metrics List:
- {"name": "node_disk_writes_merged_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The number of writes merged."}
- {"name": "container_fs_writes_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Cumulative count of writes completed"}
- {"name": "node_disk_writes_completed_total", "type": "counter", "description": "The total number of writes completed successfully."}
- {"name": "container_fs_write_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Cumulative count of seconds spent writing"}
- {"name": "node_disk_write_time_seconds_total", "type": "counter", "description": "This is the total number of seconds spent by all writes."}
- {"name": "container_fs_writes_bytes_total", "type": "counter", "description": "Cumulative count of bytes written"}
Question: How rapidly have the write operations increased for the containers of the voucher service on node k8s-node2, according to the last two data points from the past 5 minutes?
